# Text is stored with LF and checked out with LF on every machine, whatever core.autocrlf says; Windows batch files and
# PowerShell scripts keep CRLF. The parts' own .gitattributes (extension-api, the mods) say the same for their folders.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
